12	//       r-sum and s-sum global reductions (the prodigy_reduce step) computed
13	//       TOGETHER in one pass: each thread accumulates r_local += g·(p_init−p)·d²
14	//       and s_local += |s| (or d²·|g|), two DPP wavefront reduces, an LDS block
15	//       tree for each, then two AGENT-scope global atomics. Mirrors the sm_90
16	//       prodigy_reduce_kernel, replacing the ATen `.sum()` pair.
