18	// COMPILE ROUTING (two passes, one header):
19	//   * HOST pass  (`!__AMDGCN__`): sees ONLY section (A). It pulls in
20	//     torch/extension.h + primitives.hpp and exposes the launchers; the thin
21	//     host launch_prodigy.hip.cpp TU resolves exactly as before.
22	//   * DEVICE pass (`__AMDGCN__` — scripts/amdgcn_check.sh — or `__HIPCC__`):
23	//     sees ONLY section (B), the device reduction kernel.
24	//
25	// HARDWARE-GATED 🟡: device-compile-verified for gfx942 only; MI300X numerics +
26	// the wave→block→AGENT bit-parity check are deferred — see
27	// HARDWARE_VALIDATION.md, Stage 5.
28	//
29	// The production TU csrc/backends/hip/gfx942/launch_prodigy.hip.cpp now
30	// #include's this header and keeps only the host launcher(s) the pybind
31	// layer calls. Migrated byte-for-byte from that TU.
